    "The 2026-09-05 baseline sweep was generated on a single host (DESKTOP-DQ67FAC / cg_nimo_01) between 05:53 and 05:54 UTC and pushed ~14:37-14:39 UTC. Indexes record pre-publication SHAs by design (lastIndexedShaMeaning OBSERVED_HEAD_AT_GENERATION), so a one-commit lag is expected and is excluded from drift counts.",
